# Open EDA Library Generator

An AI-powered EDA library generation platform.

## Vision

Generate IPC-compliant:

- Symbols
- Footprints
- 3D Models

from semiconductor datasheets automatically.

## Initial Goal

Upload Datasheet PDF

↓

Extract Package Information

↓

Generate IPC Footprint

↓

Export KiCad Library

## Supported Outputs

- KiCad
- Altium
- OrCAD
- Allegro

## Roadmap

### Phase 1
Datasheet Parsing

### Phase 2
Package Recognition

### Phase 3
IPC Footprint Generation

### Phase 4
Symbol Generation

### Phase 5
Community Portal

